# Allowlist. Exclude everything, then re-include only the site.
# With no build step, anything committed gets a public URL by default —
# a denylist would ship each new working note until someone remembered to add it.
*

!*.html
!css/
!js/
!fonts/
!img/
!favicon.svg
!resume.pdf
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!vercel.json

# stats.json is deliberately NOT re-included: it is served through a rewrite
# from the stats branch, and a deployed copy would override that rewrite.
